Why this patch exists: Workflow bundles workflow and step files with its own esbuild (dist/base-builder.js),
outside the app's Vite pipeline, in the dev server, in @workflow/vitest and in `pnpm build`. workflow 5.0.1 has no
option to add esbuild plugins there, so `#learn/*` imports in steps ignored the course's active slots. This adds
the plugins set on globalThis[Symbol.for("workflow.esbuildPlugins")] (see src/workflows/esbuild-plugins.ts) to
the start of the steps and workflow builds. Drop it once @workflow/builders takes an esbuild plugins option.

